SUMMARY:East End Kids Pride 2026
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join us for East End Kids Pride 2026\, an opportunity to come together with rainbow families\, friends\, neighbours\, and the east end queer community to celebrate #EastEndLove and queer joy! This year’s program theme is “Fantastical Fairies and Fauna”. Come enjoy performances\, face painting\, a magical parade led by Shadowland Theatre\, dancing\, a Queer Arts Market\, Art Stations\, Snacks\, Community Love\, Queer Joy\, art stations\, and so much more to kick off Pride Month together!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/east-end-kids-pride-2026/
LOCATION:Dentonia Park\, 80 Thyra Ave\, Toronto\, M4C 5G3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/27122222/EEKP-Banners.png
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
